    <string name="how_to_prepare">How to prepare:</string>
    <string name="start_workout">START WORKOUT</string>
    <string name="instructions_squats">📱 Place your phone SIDEWAYS at waist height\n📏 Stand at a distance of 1.5-2 meters\n👤 Make sure your whole body is visible in the frame\n💡 Turn on good lighting\n👕 Wear fitted clothes (avoid baggy)\n\n🏋️ Tips for squats:\n - Feet shoulder-width apart\n - Keep your back straight\n - Knees should not go past your toes\n - Lower until thighs are parallel to the floor</string>
    <string name="instructions_pushups">📱 Place your phone SIDEWAYS on the floor\n📏 Position the camera 1.5-2 meters to your side\n👤 Make sure your whole body is visible in the frame\n💡 Turn on good lighting\n👕 Wear fitted clothes (avoid baggy)\n\n💪 Tips for push-ups:\n - Hands slightly wider than shoulders\n - Keep your body in a straight line\n - Lower your chest to the floor\n - Do not let hips sag or rise</string>
    <string name="instructions_jumping_jacks">📱 Place your phone on the floor facing you\n📏 Stand at a distance of 2-3 meters\n👤 Make sure your whole body is visible in the frame\n💡 Turn on good lighting\n👕 Wear fitted clothes (avoid baggy)\n\n⭐ Tips for jumping jacks:\n - Start with feet together, arms at sides\n - Jump and spread legs shoulder-width\n - Raise arms above your head simultaneously\n - Keep a steady, consistent rhythm</string>
    <string name="instructions_plank">📱 Place your phone SIDEWAYS on the floor\n📏 Position the camera 2 meters to your side\n👤 Make sure your whole body is visible in the frame\n💡 Turn on good lighting\n👕 Wear fitted clothes (avoid baggy)\n\n🧘 Tips for plank:\n - Elbows directly under shoulders\n - Body must form a straight line\n - Engage your core and glutes\n - Do not hold your breath - breathe steadily</string>

