    <!-- Guide Screen -->
    <string name="guide_title">📖 Guide</string>
    <string name="guide_start_title">🚀 How to start</string>
    <string name="guide_start_text">1. Choose an exercise on the main screen\n\n2. Prepare a place for training\n\n3. Install your phone according to the instructions\n\n4. Start training!</string>
    <string name="guide_camera_title">📱 Phone setup</string>
    <string name="guide_camera_text">• Place your phone SIDEWAYS (landscape mode)\n\n• Camera should be at waist level\n\n• Distance: 1.5-2 meters\n\n• Your whole body should be in the frame\n\n• Use a stand, tripod or stack of books</string>
    <string name="guide_lighting_title">💡 Lighting</string>
    <string name="guide_lighting_text">• Train in good lighting\n\n• Light should be in front, not behind\n\n• Avoid harsh shadows\n\n• Best to train during the day by the window</string>
    <string name="guide_clothes_title">👕 What to wear</string>
    <string name="guide_clothes_text">• Wear tight-fitting sportswear\n\n• Avoid loose or baggy clothing\n\n• Joints should be clearly visible\n\n• Contrasting colors improve tracking accuracy</string>
    <string name="guide_tips_title">💪 Training tips</string>
    <string name="guide_tips_text">• Warm up before training\n\n• Listen to voice prompts\n\n• Focus on technique, not speed\n\n• Start with a small number of reps\n\n• Gradually increase the load\n\n• Rest between sets\n\n• Train regularly</string>

